(1, 'Rental', 'Reynaldo Francisco', '2026-06-16', 'MANILA', 'Philippine Coast Guard HQ', '2026-06-30', 'NEW', 'Sharp', '2026-06-30', 'Various', '315', 'N/A', '70', 'N/A', '', '', '', '', 'MM', 'MM', '139 25th St, Port Area, Manila, 108 Metro Manila', 'LTJG JESSAH MAE C KIL-O PCG', 'Head BAC Secretariat', '0963 223 0665', 'hsgbac@gmail.com', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'n/a', 'N/A', 'hsgbac@gmail.com', 'RENTAL SERVICES OF MULTI-FUNCTION PRINTER (MFP) FOR VARIOUS OFFICES', '627321', NULL, NULL, 'N/A', 'Rental', '139 25th St, Port Area, Manila, 108 Metro Manila', '255', '32', NULL, '2026-07-06', '348', '', '1. June 16,2026, i submitted our Bid. opening of bid will be June 17 2026 10:00 AM.\r\n2. JUNE 17 2026 We are declared lowest calculated bid for the project\r\n3. JUNE 25 2026 We received an email Notice of Disqualification.\r\n4.  july 3 2026 we recieved a letter from pcg motion of reconsideration denied. \r\n', NULL, NULL, 10, 'Main Office', '315', NULL, NULL, '0000-00-00', '0000-00-00', '', '', '', 'CSD', NULL, 29, '2026-06-17 00:45:45', 0, NULL, 'July'),
(2, 'Rental', 'Reynaldo Francisco', '2026-06-15', 'MANILA', 'World Health Organization', '2026-07-31', 'NEW', 'Fujifilm', '2026-07-01', 'Various', '324', 'N/A', '70', 'N/A', '', '', '', '', 'MM', 'MM', 'HXJM+MQW, United Nations Ave, Ermita, Manila, 1000 Metro Manila', 'Meriz Magante', 'Regional Buyer  Procurement and Supply  Division of Business Operations & Solutions (BOS)', '998 9601722', 'MaganteM@who.int', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'N/A', 'N/A', 'MaganteM@who.int', 'Provision of Multifunction Devices, Production Machines, and Managed Print Services', '342464', NULL, '', 'N/A', 'Rental', 'HXJM+MQW, United Nations Ave, Ermita, Manila, 1000 Metro Manila', '255', '28', NULL, '2026-09-11', '230', '', '1.Last June 15, 2026 we submitted our bid proposal for the project.\r\n2. june 17 ,2026 we will conduct demo of BHC251 with ysoft in WHO site.\r\n3. June 18, 2026 we will conduct demo of C4070 in pet plans  \r\n4. June 19 2026 Cldient request to send a proposal with ysoft cloud and INNEX \r\n5. june 24 2026  follow result of bidding and as per Ms Meriz still ongoing evaluation \r\n6. July 3 2026  assist cleint email request to revise our financial bid proposal including the Ysofy cloud \r\n7. july 15 2026 client email request our final and best offer \r\nOption 1  EMR Php 293,339.00\r\nOption 2 EMR Php 301,489.00\r\nOption 3 EMR Php 285,774.00\r\nOption 4 EMR php 293,934.00\r\n8. July 27 2026  follow up customer final result of the bidding will be announce very soon and client did not give any information  \r\n9. August 5 2026- As per the client’s advice, the bidding result will be announced very soon. Additionally, the client has raised inquiries regarding the availability of our proposed PP machine option (DF) and the origin of supply.\r\nThe client is also requesting us to conduct a demo for the INNEX next week, scheduled between August 10 to 14, 2026.', '2026-09-11', NULL, 32, 'Main Office', '324', NULL, NULL, '0000-00-00', '0000-00-00', '', '', '', 'CSD', NULL, 29, '2026-06-17 00:54:51', 0, NULL, 'September'),
(3, 'Rental', 'Michaela Cedilla', '2026-06-10', 'MAKATI', 'TOYO CONSTRUCTIONS CO., LTD.', '2026-08-31', 'NEW', 'N/A', '0000-00-00', 'Centralized', '311', 'N/A', '344', 'N/A', '', '', '', '', 'MM', 'MM', '3F Planters Products Inc., Building, 109 Esteban Street, Legaspi Village, Makati City   ', 'Joshua Gambol', 'IT', '09937425967', 'N@A', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'N/A', 'N/A', 'N@A', 'TOYO CONSTRUCTIONS CO., LTD.', '46428', NULL, NULL, 'Installment', 'Rental', '3F Planters Products Inc., Building, 109 Esteban Street, Legaspi Village, Makati City   ', '255', 'N/A', NULL, '2026-06-17', '230', '', 'FOR DELIVERY', '2026-06-17', NULL, 2, 'Main Office', '311', NULL, NULL, '0000-00-00', '0000-00-00', '', '', '', 'CSD', NULL, 63, '2026-06-17 01:28:35', 0, NULL, 'June'),
(4, 'Rental', 'Reymund Rodelas', '2026-06-16', 'MAKATI', 'HEALTWAY / MCH ', '2027-07-23', 'NEW', 'Fujifilm', '0000-00-00', 'Various', '316', 'N/A', '70', 'N/A', '', '', '', '', 'MM', 'MM', 'MSE BLDG MAKATI CITY', 'RONELI DEL POSO', 'CORPORATE PROCUREMENT ASSOCIATES MANAGER', '905 439 6450', 'delposo.ro@healthway.com.ph', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'N/A', '', '', 'PRINT MANAGEMENT', '13191', NULL, '', 'Check', 'Rental', 'MSE BLDG MAKATI CITY', '255', '27', NULL, '2026-06-17', '230', '', 'WITH NOA FOF 5 UNITS / UNDER NEGO FOR OTHER BU', '2026-06-17', NULL, 3, 'Main Office', '316', NULL, NULL, '0000-00-00', '0000-00-00', '', '', '', 'CSD', NULL, 26, '2026-06-17 01:34:58', 0, NULL, 'June'),
(5, 'Rental', 'Bien Valdez', '2026-06-17', 'MANILA', 'INFRAMACHINERIES CORP. ', '0000-00-00', 'NEW', 'N/A', '0000-00-00', 'Centralized', '311', 'N/A', '74', 'N/A', '', '', '', '', 'MM', 'MM', 'Lot 6, Barangay Mamplasan Road, Binan City, Laguna, Biñan, Philippines', 'MARCOS SANGGA', 'IT MANAGER', '09985113142', 'marcos.sangga@inframachineries.com', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'N/A', '', '', 'INFRAMACHINERIES CORP. ', '11200', NULL, NULL, 'N/A', 'Rental', 'Lot 6, Barangay Mamplasan Road, Binan City, Laguna, Biñan, Philippines', '255', 'N/A', NULL, '2026-08-13', '346', '', '1. Waiting for Management approval (Proposal)\r\n2. June 24,2026. Client will go, for this, but if theres a 24 contract instead.\r\n3. JULY 1,2026. MEETING WITH HEAD IT MR. MCCOY SANGGA. WE BOTH AGREE ON 24 MONTHS CONTRACT FOR 2 UNITS AND WILL POSIBLE TO HAVE AN ADDITIONAL 2 UNITS AFTERWARDS. FREE 3 DAYS DEMO WILL BE HELD NEXT WEEK. PROPOSAL AND DRAFT CONTRACT FOR REVIEW.\r\n4.JULY 13,2026. TODAY IS THE LAST DAY OF FREE 3 DAYS DEMO AT\r\nMANILA AND MAMPLASAN HEAD OFFICE. AS PER ADVICE BY MR.MACCOY WAITING FOR THE FINALIZATION OF THE PROPOSAL AND CONTRACT.\r\n5. July 23, 2026 — As discussed yesterday with Sir McCoy, the contact person, the target delivery date is July 2026. We are still waiting for the signed proposal and contract, but the documents are already prepared for submission. \r\nAugust 3, 2026. Follow up with our client regarding the signed proposal and contract. Mr. McCoy advised that he will get back to us once it is signed and finalized. Please stand by.\r\n6. AUG 13,2026. THIS PAST FEW DAYS OF MY FOLLOW UP, MR. MCCOY OUR CONTACT PERSON IS NOT RESPONSIVE TO OUR CALLS AND MESSAGES. WE ARE PLANNING TO SURPRISE VISIT NEXT WEEK.', NULL, NULL, 2, 'Main Office', '311', NULL, NULL, '0000-00-00', '0000-00-00', '', '', '', 'CSD', NULL, 92, '2026-06-17 02:20:09', 0, NULL, 'August'),
(6, 'Rental', 'Bien Valdez', '2026-06-17', 'MANILA', 'UNITED GRAPHIC EXPRESSION CORPORATION-CAVITE', '0000-00-00', 'EXISTING', NULL, '0000-00-00', 'Centralized', '328', '186', '254', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'MM', 'LUZON', 'Technopark, UGEC Corporate Centre, Governor\'s Dr, Dasmariñas, Cavite', 'SHYRVIE ARTUZ', 'PURCHASING STAFF', '09173174422', 'sartuz@ugecorp.com', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'N/A', '', '', 'UNITED GRAPHIC EXPRESSION CORPORATION-CAVITE', '12550', NULL, NULL, 'N/A', 'Rental', 'Technopark, UGEC Corporate Centre, Governor\'s Dr, Dasmariñas, Cavite', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-07-16', '349', '', '1. ADDITIONAL UNIT (MONO), PROPOSAL FOR REVIEW AND HAVING A MEETING THIS WEEK FOR FINALIZATION.\r\n2. An ongoing review is being conducted to determine whether they will pursue the additional unit.\r\n3. JULY 6.2026. AS PER CLIENT MS. SHYRVIE, STILL NO FEED BACK FROM GEN.MANAGER AND WILL UPDATE ME ONCE IT IS APPROVED.', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Main Office', '328', NULL, NULL, '0000-00-00', '0000-00-00', '', 'N/A', '', 'CSD', NULL, 92, '2026-06-17 02:28:52', 0, NULL, 'July'),
