(8, 'Rental', 'Bien Valdez', '2026-06-17', 'MANILA', 'INTERNATIONAL CHRISTIAN ACADEMY', '0000-00-00', 'NEW', 'N/A', '0000-00-00', 'Centralized', '314', 'N/A', '344', 'N/A', '', '', '', '', 'MM', 'MM', '4505 Extra Extension Street Fourth Estate Subdivision, Parañaque - Sucat Rd, San Antonio, Parañaque,', 'PR. LUIS A.B. BARRETTO IV', 'Senior Pastor', '09171181399', 'Louie.barretto@wwcf.ph', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'PR. LUIS A.B. BARRETTO IV', 'Senior Pastor', 'Louie.barretto@wwcf.ph', 'INTERNATIONAL CHRISTIAN ACADEMY', '10000', NULL, NULL, 'N/A', 'Rental', '4505 Extra Extension Street Fourth Estate Subdivision, Parañaque - Sucat Rd, San Antonio, Parañaque, Metro Manila', '255', 'N/A', NULL, '2026-08-06', '346', '', '1. PROPOSAL FOR REVIEW, WAITING FOR THE NUMBERS OF SCHOOL ENROLLIES.\r\n2. We are currently awaiting updates on our proposal, as the client has indicated that it will be brought forward in a management meeting.\r\n3. JULY 6,2026. WAITING FOR ICA PRESIDENT FOR REVIEW.\r\n4. JULY 16,2026. CCF HEAD OFFICE IS STILL UNDECIDED TO CONTINIOUE THE PROJECT.. THEYWILL UPDATE US AT THE END OF JULY.\r\n5. JULY 27,2026. PROJECT HOLD AS OF NOW DUE TO SOME PROJECT ARE PRIORITIZED. HOWEVER CLIENT INFORMED US TO WAIT FOR THEIR ADVICE. \r\n6. July 27, 2026 – Update from Client: Rental is on hold, but they will inform us if they decide to pursue it in October.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'Main Office', '314', NULL, NULL, '0000-00-00', '0000-00-00', '', '', '', 'CSD', NULL, 92, '2026-06-17 02:45:48', 0, NULL, 'October'),
