(457, 17, '2026-07-27', 346, NULL, '1. FOR REVIEW PROPOSAL\r\n2. It is already on the company president’s table for review.\r\n3. JULY 6,2026. AS PER CLIENT, STILL NO FEED BACK FROM THE PRESIDENT. ONCE IIS APPROVED THEY WILL GIVE US UPDATE.\r\n4. JULY 16,2026. The WESCO Purchasing Team is conducting a study to determine whether to proceed with rental or outright purchase.\r\n5. JULY 27,2026. I VISITED  THE ACCOUNT AND MEET MS. LEILANIE ANDAYA OUR CONTACT PERSON INFORMED US TO WAIT THEIR ADVICE, AS OF NOW THE PRESIDENT IS BUSY TO CHECK THE PROPOSAL.', 'September', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-26 23:59:13'),
(458, 18, '2026-07-27', 349, NULL, '1. FOR REVIEW PROPOSAL\r\n2. STILL FOR REVIEW BY THEIR HEAD OFFICE.\r\n3. JUYL 6,2026. STILL UNDER EVALUATION BY PURCHASING TEAM IF THEY PURSUE OUTHRIGHT PURCHASE OR RENTAL. \r\n4. JULY 16,2026. Purchasing Team is conducting a study to determine whether to proceed with rental or outright purchase. It was also advised that the printer is currently not a priority.\r\n5. JULY 27,2026. CLIENT INFORMED US THEY WILL PURSUE THE RENTAL DUE TO IT IS NOT THEIR PRIONITY AS OF NOW AND CURRENTLY NO BUDGET.', 'August', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-27 00:02:39'),
(459, 20, '2026-07-27', 346, NULL, '1. FOR REVIEW PROPOSAL\r\n2. The Purchasing Department is currently reviewing and comparing expenses between Canon printers (company owned) versus canvass rental unit.\r\n3. JULY 6,2026. ALREADY FORWARDED TO IT DEPT FOR REVIEW AND PRICING COMPARISON TO THEIR EXICTING.\r\n4. JULY 16,2026. They already forwarded the proposal to the IT Team to review.\r\n5. JULY 27,2026. UNDER NEGO FOR NEW PROPOSAL, PLANNING FOR A SHORT MEETING THIS WEEK FOR THE REQUIREMENTS.', 'August', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-27 00:04:26'),
