(582, 8, '2026-08-06', 346, NULL, '1. PROPOSAL FOR REVIEW, WAITING FOR THE NUMBERS OF SCHOOL ENROLLIES.\r\n2. We are currently awaiting updates on our proposal, as the client has indicated that it will be brought forward in a management meeting.\r\n3. JULY 6,2026. WAITING FOR ICA PRESIDENT FOR REVIEW.\r\n4. JULY 16,2026. CCF HEAD OFFICE IS STILL UNDECIDED TO CONTINIOUE THE PROJECT.. THEYWILL UPDATE US AT THE END OF JULY.\r\n5. JULY 27,2026. PROJECT HOLD AS OF NOW DUE TO SOME PROJECT ARE PRIORITIZED. HOWEVER CLIENT INFORMED US TO WAIT FOR THEIR ADVICE. \r\n6. July 27, 2026 – Update from Client: Rental is on hold, but they will inform us if they decide to pursue it in October.', 'October', NULL, NULL, '2026-08-06 00:04:25'),
(583, 17, '2026-08-06', 346, NULL, '1. FOR REVIEW PROPOSAL\r\n2. It is already on the company president’s table for review.\r\n3. JULY 6,2026. AS PER CLIENT, STILL NO FEED BACK FROM THE PRESIDENT. ONCE IIS APPROVED THEY WILL GIVE US UPDATE.\r\n4. JULY 16,2026. The WESCO Purchasing Team is conducting a study to determine whether to proceed with rental or outright purchase.\r\n5. JULY 27,2026. I VISITED  THE ACCOUNT AND MEET MS. LEILANIE ANDAYA OUR CONTACT PERSON INFORMED US TO WAIT THEIR ADVICE, AS OF NOW THE PRESIDENT IS BUSY TO CHECK THE PROPOSAL.\r\n6. AUGUST 6,2026. STILL ONGOING REVIEW BY THEIR PRESIDENT.', 'September', NULL, NULL, '2026-08-06 00:07:16'),
(584, 20, '2026-08-06', 346, NULL, '1. FOR REVIEW PROPOSAL\r\n2. The Purchasing Department is currently reviewing and comparing expenses between Canon printers (company owned) versus canvass rental unit.\r\n3. JULY 6,2026. ALREADY FORWARDED TO IT DEPT FOR REVIEW AND PRICING COMPARISON TO THEIR EXICTING.\r\n4. JULY 16,2026. They already forwarded the proposal to the IT Team to review.\r\n5. JULY 27,2026. UNDER NEGO FOR NEW PROPOSAL, PLANNING FOR A SHORT MEETING THIS WEEK FOR THE REQUIREMENTS.\r\n6. AUGUST 6,2026. 6. Update from Client: Rental is on hold, but they will inform us if they decide to pursue it in October.', 'October', NULL, NULL, '2026-08-06 00:08:37'),
(585, 26, '2026-08-06', 346, NULL, '1. PROPOSAL FOR REVIEW/ ADDITIONAL COLOR / EXISITING \r\n2. An ongoing review is being conducted with management; however, the client has not provided any commitment regarding the target date.\r\n3. july 6 2026 follow up client as per contact person she will follow up to the end user and get back to us until friday. \r\n4. july 16 2026 follow up client as per contact person waiting for the review and also new office is still under construction estimated compltion is around september.\r\n5. JULY 27,2026. LAST WEEK UPON OUR CONVERTION, AS WE DISCUSSED BY MS. AJ. THE PROJECT IS STILL ON GOING, THE RENOVATION IS ON GOING, AND THE WILL PURSUE THE RENTAL ON NOVEMBER OR DECEMBER 2025.\r\n6. AUGUST 6,2026. AS DISCUSSED BY MS. AJ. THE PROJECT IS STILL ON GOING, THE RENOVATION IS ON GOING, AND THE WILL PURSUE THE RENTAL ON NOVEMBER OR DECEMBER 2025.', 'November', NULL, NULL, '2026-08-06 00:10:52'),
(586, 45, '2026-08-06', 346, NULL, '1. PROPOSAL ADDITIONAL MACHINE BH-C3351i - ILOILO BRANCH\r\nJuly 6 2026  follow up proposal as per advice by our contract person our proposal is for review and for discussion at this moment\r\n2. july 16 2026 still under review and also we provide a OP proposal as client request\r\n3. JULY 27,2026. WAITING FOR APPROVAL.\r\n4. AUGUST 6,2026. STILL WAITING FOR MANAGENET APPROVAL.', 'September', NULL, NULL, '2026-08-06 00:12:55'),
