(588, 74, '2026-08-06', 346, NULL, '1. PROPOSAL FOR ADDITIONAL (1) BH-250i BN WITH OPTION 1 YSOFT ONPREM AND YSOFT CLOUD. FOR REVIEW\r\n2. july 6 2026 - call client  follow up status of proposal as per advice by our contact person Mr Jovie July 7 2026 he will present the proposal to the management.\r\n3. july 16 2026  as per contact person already presented to the management and requesting discount of the proposal.\r\n4. JULY 27,2026. WAITING FOR APPROVAL.\r\n5. AUGUST 6,2026. WAITING FOR APPROVAL FROM THE MANAGEMENT.', 'August', NULL, NULL, '2026-08-06 00:15:37'),
