(676, 31, '2026-08-11', 345, NULL, 'Option 2 Php2,112,018.00 BH207iBN - 47units\r\nOption 3 Php2,532,308.00 BH367 -47 units with YSOFT\r\nOption 4 Php2,087,187.00 BH207iBN - 47 units with YSOFT\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n- Fujifilm contract is extended while they can still support services for machine spart parts and consumables - Follow-up product demo \r\n- Visited July 09 - Already endorsed with IT dept. though still status on Fujifilm contract\r\n- To date as per Ms. Hazel (Procurement) Fujifilm contract is extended while they can still support services for machine spart parts and consumables.\r\n- CSO follow-up schedule for product presentation\r\n- Visit 10.9.2026 - Proposal for IT evaluation; FUJIFILM contract status quo for a 3 mos extension until they cannot provide such services of SMB existing units. payment based on monthly consumption via click charge.\r\n- Still under 3 mos  extension till September 2026 or until their existing units are not serviceable by FUJIFILM.', 'October', NULL, NULL, '2026-08-11 02:04:08'),
