(681, 2, '2026-08-11', 230, NULL, '1.Last June 15, 2026 we submitted our bid proposal for the project.\r\n2. june 17 ,2026 we will conduct demo of BHC251 with ysoft in WHO site.\r\n3. June 18, 2026 we will conduct demo of C4070 in pet plans  \r\n4. June 19 2026 Cldient request to send a proposal with ysoft cloud and INNEX \r\n5. june 24 2026  follow result of bidding and as per Ms Meriz still ongoing evaluation \r\n6. July 3 2026  assist cleint email request to revise our financial bid proposal including the Ysofy cloud \r\n7. july 15 2026 client email request our final and best offer \r\nOption 1  EMR Php 293,339.00\r\nOption 2 EMR Php 301,489.00\r\nOption 3 EMR Php 285,774.00\r\nOption 4 EMR php 293,934.00\r\n8. July 27 2026  follow up customer final result of the bidding will be announce very soon and client did not give any information  \r\n9. August 5 2026- As per the client’s advice, the bidding result will be announced very soon. Additionally, the client has raised inquiries regarding the availability of our proposed PP machine option (DF) and the origin of supply.\r\nThe client is also requesting us to conduct a demo for the INNEX next week, scheduled between August 10 to 14, 2026.', 'July', NULL, NULL, '2026-08-11 04:57:09'),
