(694, 5, '2026-08-13', 346, NULL, '1. Waiting for Management approval (Proposal)\r\n2. June 24,2026. Client will go, for this, but if theres a 24 contract instead.\r\n3. JULY 1,2026. MEETING WITH HEAD IT MR. MCCOY SANGGA. WE BOTH AGREE ON 24 MONTHS CONTRACT FOR 2 UNITS AND WILL POSIBLE TO HAVE AN ADDITIONAL 2 UNITS AFTERWARDS. FREE 3 DAYS DEMO WILL BE HELD NEXT WEEK. PROPOSAL AND DRAFT CONTRACT FOR REVIEW.\r\n4.JULY 13,2026. TODAY IS THE LAST DAY OF FREE 3 DAYS DEMO AT\r\nMANILA AND MAMPLASAN HEAD OFFICE. AS PER ADVICE BY MR.MACCOY WAITING FOR THE FINALIZATION OF THE PROPOSAL AND CONTRACT.\r\n5. July 23, 2026 — As discussed yesterday with Sir McCoy, the contact person, the target delivery date is July 2026. We are still waiting for the signed proposal and contract, but the documents are already prepared for submission. \r\nAugust 3, 2026. Follow up with our client regarding the signed proposal and contract. Mr. McCoy advised that he will get back to us once it is signed and finalized. Please stand by.\r\n6. AUG 13,2026. THIS PAST FEW DAYS OF MY FOLLOW UP, MR. MCCOY OUR CONTACT PERSON IS NOT RESPONSIVE TO OUR CALLS AND MESSAGES. WE ARE PLANNING TO SURPRISE VISIT NEXT WEEK.', 'August', NULL, NULL, '2026-08-13 00:12:01'),
(695, 27, '2026-08-13', 346, NULL, '1. FMR PLUS ACTUAL, 13 UNITS MONOAND 13 UNIT COLOR. PLUS 1 COLORED BACK UP UNIT, IFPD BUNDLE, AND YSOFT CLOUD. MEETING WITH CLIENT TODAY JUNE 19 2026 AND WITH SIR DALE, SIR, JOEY AND SIR REY.\r\n2. SEND PROPOSAL/FOR REVIEW, SEND EMAIL FOR ONSITE DEMO ON JULY 1,2026.\r\nKM BH367,BH550i,C301i, BH-C551i, INNEX IFPD, YSOFT CLOUD AND DOCUVU.\r\n3. JULY 1,2026. CONFIRMATION FROM CLIENT MR. JHON PAUL MACASAET OF ONSITE FREE DEMO FOR MFP AND IFPD ON JULY 3 FRIDAY 2PM WITH HIS TEAM, IT DEPT AND END USERS.\r\n4. JULY 3,2026. SCHEDULED 6 DAYS FREE DEMO OF BH-C301i AND IFPD. ALSO REQUESTING FOR DISCOUNT FOR ON MONO PHP 0.50.\r\n5. JULY 13,2026. THE 6 DAYS DEMO IS FINISHED AND AS PER ADVICE BY MR.JHON PAUL, WAITING FOR THE FINALIZATION OF THE APPROVAL FROM THE ADMIN.\r\n6. JULY 23,2026. STILL WAITING FOR THE FINALIZATION OF THE APPROVAL FROM THE ADMIN AS PER CONTACT PERSON. TARGET DATE IS SEPTEMBER 2026.\r\n7. August 3, 2026. I call Mr. Jhon Macasaet to arrange a drop-off visit for the second week of August.\r\n8. AUG 13,2026. YESTERDAY SUPPOSED TO BE OUT DROP OFF VISIT BUBT CLIENT INFORMED US THAT THE ADMIN AND END USERS ARE NOT AVAILABALE. THEY ARE REQUESTING FOR RESCHEDULE OF VISIT AND WILL ANNOUNCED THE RESULT.', 'September', NULL, NULL, '2026-08-13 00:14:54'),
